@startuml Account Management Flow
title B2B & B2C Account Management

actor B2BCustomer as "B2B Customer"
actor B2CCustomer as "B2C Customer"
participant Portal as "Customer Portal"
participant Controller as "AccountController"
participant Service as "AccountService"
participant Database as "Salesforce DB"
participant Email as "Email Service"

== B2B Account Management ==
B2BCustomer -> Portal: Access account dashboard
Portal -> Controller: getAccountDetails(accountId)
Controller -> Database: SELECT Account, Contact, User__c data
Database --> Controller: Account information
Controller --> Portal: Account profile + team members

== B2B Order History ==
B2BCustomer -> Portal: View order history
Portal -> Controller: getOrderHistory(accountId, filters)
Controller -> Database: SELECT Orders with TALEXO_Quote__c links
Database --> Controller: Order + quote history
Controller --> Portal: Formatted order list

== B2B Quote Requests ==
B2BCustomer -> Portal: Request custom quote
Portal -> Controller: createQuoteRequest(requestData)
Controller -> Service: generateQuoteFromRequest()
Service -> Database: INSERT TALEXO_Quote__c with status 'Requested'
Database --> Service: Quote created
Service -> Email: Notify sales team
Email --> Service: Email sent
Service --> Controller: Quote request submitted
Controller --> Portal: Confirmation + quote tracking

== B2C Account Management ==
B2CCustomer -> Portal: Access profile
Portal -> Controller: getProfile(userId)
Controller -> Database: SELECT B2CUser__c + preferences
Database --> Controller: User profile data
Controller --> Portal: Profile information

== B2C Wishlist Management ==
B2CCustomer -> Portal: Manage wishlist
Portal -> Controller: getWishlist(userId)
Controller -> Database: SELECT WishlistItem__c
Database --> Controller: Wishlist products
Controller --> Portal: Wishlist display

B2CCustomer -> Portal: Add to wishlist
Portal -> Controller: addToWishlist(productId, userId)
Controller -> Database: INSERT/UPDATE WishlistItem__c
Database --> Controller: Success
Controller --> Portal: Updated wishlist

== Password Management ==
note over B2BCustomer, B2CCustomer
    Both B2B and B2C users can:
    - Change password
    - Reset forgotten password
    - Update profile information
    - Manage notification preferences
end note

Customer -> Portal: Change password
Portal -> Controller: updatePassword(current, new)
Controller -> AuthService: validateCurrentPassword()
AuthService -> Database: Verify password hash
Database --> AuthService: Validation result
AuthService --> Controller: Password updated
Controller --> Portal: Success message

== Notification Preferences ==
Customer -> Portal: Update preferences
Portal -> Controller: updatePreferences(preferences)
Controller -> Database: UPDATE User__c/B2CUser__c
Database --> Controller: Updated
Controller --> Portal: Preferences saved
@enduml